      "refersTo": "button-landing-cta",
      "description": "Landing-only white pill with a black arrow badge at the end.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-cta\" href=\"#\">התחילו בחינם<span class=\"ds-cta-badge\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m12 19-7-7 7-7\"/><path d=\"M19 12H5\"/></svg></span></a>",
      "css": ".ds-cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;height:56px;padding-inline:28px 8px;border-radius:9999px;background:#fff;color:#000;font:700 16px/1 var(--font-sans);text-decoration:none;transition:transform .2s}.ds-cta:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}.ds-cta:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #e4494f;outline-offset:3px}.ds-cta-badge{display:grid;place-items:center;width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:9999px;background:#000;color:#fff}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text Input",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "36px field; 16px text on mobile.",
      "html": "<input class=\"ds-input\" placeholder=\"משקל (ק״ג)\" inputmode=\"decimal\">",
      "css": ".ds-input{height:36px;width:100%;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid var(--input);border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:var(--foreground);font:400 16px/1.5 var(--font-sans);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);transition:box-shadow .15s}.ds-input::placeholder{color:var(--muted-foreground)}.ds-input:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px var(--ring)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Area Tile",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "area-tile",
      "description": "Signature 4:5 photo card with a scrim, title and frosted chevron.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-tile\" href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-tile-scrim\"></span><span class=\"ds-tile-text\"><b>חזה</b><small>4 תרגילים</small></span><span class=\"ds-tile-chev\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m15 18-6-6 6-6\"/></svg></span></a>",
      "css": ".ds-tile{position:relative;display:block;width:180px;aspect-ratio:4/5;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3a3a3a,#141414);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);direction:rtl;transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s}.ds-tile:hover{box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg)}.ds-tile:active{transform:scale(.98)}.ds-tile:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--background),0 0 0 4px var(--ring)}.ds-tile-scrim{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(to top,rgb(0 0 0/.9),rgb(0 0 0/.35),transparent)}.ds-tile-text{position:absolute;bottom:16px;inset-inline-start:16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;color:#fff;font-family:var(--font-sans)}.ds-tile-text b{font-size:18px;font-weight:900}.ds-tile-text small{font-size:14px;opacity:.8;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-tile-chev{position:absolute;bottom:16px;inset-inline-end:16px;display:grid;place-items:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:9999px;background:rgb(255 255 255/.15);color:#fff;backdrop-filter:blur(8px);transition:background-color .2s}.ds-tile:hover .ds-tile-chev{background:var(--primary)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Set Progress Dots",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "set-dots",
      "description": "Done (tinted + check), current (solid red, small glow), upcoming (muted).",
      "html": "<ol class=\"ds-dots\"><li class=\"is-done\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg></li><li class=\"is-current\">2</li><li>3</li></ol>",
      "css": ".ds-dots{display:flex;gap:8px;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;direction:rtl}.ds-dots li{display:grid;place-items:center;min-width:32px;height:32px;padding:0 8px;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--muted);color:var(--muted-foreground);font:700 14px/1 var(--font-sans);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;transition:background-color .2s}.ds-dots .is-done{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--primary) 15%,transparent);color:var(--primary)}.ds-dots .is-current{background:var(--primary);color:var(--primary-foreground);box-shadow:0 4px 6px -1px color-mix(in srgb,var(--primary) 30%,transparent)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Liquid Glass Dock",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "mobile-dock",
      "description": "Signature mobile-only bottom dock in liquid glass.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-dock\" aria-label=\"תפריט ניווט\"><span class=\"ds-dock-avatar\">א</span><span class=\"ds-dock-label\">אזורי אימון</span><button class=\"ds-dock-btn\" aria-label=\"פתח תפריט\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"/></svg></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-dock{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;width:320px;padding:8px;border-radius:9999px;direction:rtl;background:var(--glass-bg);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(24px) saturate(180%);backdrop-filter:blur(24px) saturate(180%);border:1px solid var(--glass-edge);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 0 var(--glass-highlight),inset 0 -1px 0 0 var(--glass-shade),0 12px 32px -8px rgb(0 0 0/.3);font-family:var(--font-sans)}.ds-dock-avatar{display:grid;place-items:center;width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--primary);color:var(--primary-foreground);font-weight:900}.ds-dock-label{flex:1;font-weight:700;color:var(--glass-ink)}.ds-dock-btn{display:grid;place-items:center;width:44px;height:44px;border:0;border-radius:9999px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--glass-ink) 8%,transparent);color:var(--glass-ink);cursor:pointer}.ds-dock-btn:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--glass-ink) 15%,transparent)}.ds-dock-btn:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--ring)}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Gym-Floor Companion",
    "overview": "",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Hebrew-native, RTL, logical properties throughout; directional icons flip in RTL.",
      "Heebo Variable only, leaning on weight 900 for every heading and number.",
      "One red accent, used for the action, the progress and the current state.",
      "Warm stone neutrals in light mode, iron blacks in dark mode and on the landing.",
      "Big tabular numerals for weight, reps, sets and timers.",
      "Liquid-glass mobile dock and a red glow under the primary action as signature depth."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The One Red Rule",
        "body": "Red means one of three things: the next action, progress, or \"you are here\". It is never decoration, and no second accent hue competes with it (amber exists only as a chart series).",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Warm Neutral Rule",
        "body": "Light surfaces are stone-tinted (Chalk, Stone Wash), not cool grey. Pure #ffffff is reserved for raised cards (Paper) and the landing's white CTA.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Heavy-or-Quiet Rule",
        "body": "Text is either 900 (it's a heading or a number) or 400–700 (it's reading). Mid-heavy 800 headings dilute the contrast.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Tabular Numbers Rule",
        "body": "Every changing number (weight, reps, set count, timer, prices, hours) uses tabular figures and is isolated with `<bdi>` where it sits in RTL text.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The No Fake Italic Rule",
        "body": "Never italicize Hebrew for emphasis; use weight or Ember Red instead.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Thumb Reach Rule",
        "body": "In-workout controls stay inside the 448px column and in the bottom half of the screen; nothing the user needs mid-set lives in the header.",
        "section": "layout"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Glow Is Earned Rule",
        "body": "The large red glow sits under exactly one element per screen: the action that completes the current step. A small glow (`shadow-md`) can mark the current item in a sequence, such as the active set dot.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** use the semantic tokens (`bg-primary`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`) so light, dark and landing all theme correctly.",
      "**Do** use logical properties (`ps-`, `pe-`, `start-`, `end-`) and flip directional icons with `rtl:-scale-x-100`.",
      "**Do** size anything touched mid-workout at 44px or larger (`size=\"touch\"`, `icon-touch`), and the step-completing action at 64px.",
      "**Do** render every changing number with `tabular-nums`, and wrap numbers, prices and times in `<bdi>` inside Hebrew text.",
      "**Do** keep the landing inside `.landing` so it stays dark and keeps its 6px radius base regardless of the app theme.",
      "**Do** honor reduced motion: the global rule collapses transitions, and the landing rise and marquee turn off completely.",
      "**Do** put a bottom-up black scrim under any white text on a photo."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** hardcode hex values in components; add or reuse a token. For red on an always-dark panel, use `ember` / `ember-deep`, not `primary` (which shifts to #c8262d in the light theme).",
      "**Don't** put the large Red glow on more than one element per screen.",
      "**Don't** italicize Hebrew or use synthetic slants for emphasis.",
      "**Don't** apply the landing's tighter radius or always-dark theme to app screens, or the app's rounder radius to the landing.",
      "**Don't** introduce a second typeface; hierarchy comes from Heebo's weight and size.",
      "**Don't** use cool grey surfaces in light mode; neutrals stay stone-warm."
    ]
  }
}
